## Format

{{ thor.description }}

- **Experts:** {{ thor.expert_bpw | f3 }} bits per weight on average, {{ thor.expert_bytes | gib }} GiB in total.
- **Whole build:** {{ thor_build.build_bytes | gib }} GiB (`thor.json` lists every file with its sha256). The dense path (attention, indexer, compressor, shared expert, router, hyper-connections) is the base checkpoint's own FP8/BF16 tensors. The vision tower and aligner are unpruned. The checkpoint's own speculative-decoding (`mtp`) blocks are included unmodified.
- **Keep-set:** `reap_keepset.json` lists, per layer, the routed experts that were kept, in their original ids. The router rows and biases were sliced to the same ids.

